  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_010_ghost_01",
      "hash64": "2BFC232B68E5F62B",
      "text": "好久不见！\\n我记得你叫……[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，对吧？[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_010_ghost_02",
      "hash64": "2BFC242B68E5F7DE",
      "text": "你今天来是为了什么？\\n是要和我来场说唱对战吗？[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_010_select_01",
      "hash64": "D9AB61BFDCE1FFB2",
      "text": "为了视察道馆！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_010_select_02",
      "hash64": "D9AB60BFDCE1FDFF",
      "text": "为了说唱对战！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_010_ghost_03a",
      "hash64": "A36D18C33EC7B2D0",
      "text": "嗯？你是说首席拜托你\\n到我这里来视察的！？[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_010_ghost_03b",
      "hash64": "A36D1BC33EC7B7E9",
      "text": "HAHAHA！\\n你的笑话也是冠军级吗！？[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_010_ghost_04",
      "hash64": "2BFC262B68E5FB44",
      "text": "哦……\\n所以你是替也慈来的啊。[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_010_ghost_05",
      "hash64": "2BFC272B68E5FCF7",
      "text": "我基本上了解状况了。\\n不过竟然会派一个菜鸟冠军来，\\r\\n我还真是被看扁了呢。[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_010_ghost_06",
      "hash64": "2BFC282B68E5FEAA",
      "text": "不好意思啊……\\n我并不是在冲你发火。[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_010_ghost_07",
      "hash64": "2BFC292B68E6005D",
      "text": "哎，不过我也确实想见你，\\n而且你人都来了，说什么都没用了。[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_010_ghost_08",
      "hash64": "2BFC1A2B68E5E6E0",
      "text": "机会难得。让我见识一下\\n你的实力怎么样？[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_010_ghost_retry",
      "hash64": "D3F660C65FD8455A",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n你准备好展示你的实力了吗？[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_010_ghost_09",
      "hash64": "2BFC1B2B68E5E893",
      "text": "这就对了，跟我来！\\n不定期举办的舞台表演要开始了！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_010_ghost_10",
      "hash64": "2BFFA82B68E90E01",
      "text": "何意？放弃？不愿意？\\n遗憾！急盼！再来战！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_010_ghost_nobattle",
      "hash64": "59E832E7A5A187B5",
      "text": "……嗯？想和我较量的话，\\n至少需要２只能对战的宝可梦！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
